#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:110
msgid "Présentation de Lyrics Slide Show"
msgstr "About Lyrics Slide Show"

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:114
msgid "Projetez. Chantez. Kiffez."
msgstr "Project. Sing. Enjoy."

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:117
msgid ""
"<strong>Lyrics Slide Show</strong> transforme tes paroles en slides claires "
"et prêtes à projeter… en quelques secondes."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Lyrics Slide Show</strong> turns your lyrics into clean, projection-"
"ready slides in seconds."

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:118
msgid ""
"Parfait pour une soirée louange, une animation musicale ou un concert "
"improvisé."
msgstr "Perfect for worship nights, music sessions, or impromptu concerts."

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:127
msgid "Pourquoi c’est cool ?"
msgstr "Why you'll love it"

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:130
msgid ""
"Tu te concentres sur la musique, pas sur la mise en page. Le texte est net, "
"lisible de loin, et tes enchaînements restent fluides."
msgstr ""
"You stay focused on the music, not the layout. The lyrics are crisp, easy to "
"read from a distance, and your flow stays smooth."

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:131
msgid ""
"Fini les bricolages sur PowerPoint, Google Slides ou Canva : ici tout est "
"pensé pour chanter, pas pour faire des diapos."
msgstr ""
"No more patching things together in PowerPoint, Google Slides, or Canva. "
"Everything here is built for singing, not slide design."

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:140
msgid "Ce que tu y gagnes"
msgstr "What you get"

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:143
msgid "🎤 Des slides propres, sans distractions."
msgstr "🎤 Clean slides with no distractions."

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:144
msgid "⚡ Une prise en main immédiate."
msgstr "⚡ Instant setup."

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:145
msgid "🎶 Des transitions sans coupure dans l’ambiance."
msgstr "🎶 Seamless transitions that keep the atmosphere going."

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:146
msgid "👥 Une salle qui suit et chante avec toi."
msgstr "👥 A room that can follow along and sing with you."

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:147
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "🎛️ Pilotage au clavier ou pédalier, comme un \"tourne-page\" pour "
#| "musiciens 👢"
msgid "🎛️ Pilotage au clavier ou pédalier, comme un \\"
msgstr "🎛️ Keyboard or pedal control, like a page-turner for musicians 👢"

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:156
msgid "A vous !"
msgstr "Your turn"

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:158
msgid ""
"« On a lancé la session en 2 minutes. Tout le monde a chanté, et on n’a "
"jamais perdu le fil. »"
msgstr ""
"“We had the session up and running in 2 minutes. Everyone joined in, and we "
"never lost momentum.”"

#: app_main/templates/main/homepage.html:160
msgid ""
"Prêt·e ? Ouvre une nouvelle session, colle tes paroles et fais monter la "
"vibe."
msgstr "Ready? Start a new session, paste in your lyrics, and lift the room."

